<title>CROATIA: Croatia June c/a deficit widens to $165.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Croatia June c/a deficit widens to $165.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENT ACCOUNT    JUNE     MAY   JAN-JUNE JAN-JUNE'95</p>
<p> Current account (million USD) -165.6  -88.7    -662.2     -817.2</p>
<p> Goods			   -294.2 -203.8  -1,392.4   -1,348.1</p>
<p> Services			  65.3   50.9     368.7	293.0</p>
<p> Income			    -1.7   -2.9     -65.9	-46.3</p>
<p> Current transfers	     64.9   67.1     427.2	284.1</p>
<p>The central bank detailed the first half balance of payments as follows.			  JUNE     MAY   JAN-JUNE JAN-JUNE'95</p>
<p> Current account	     -165.5  -88.7    -662.2     -817.2</p>
<p> Capital and fin. account   -47.9   54.4	48.4	 90.4</p>
<p> -Reserve assets		-99.9  -43.0    -124.0     -421.1</p>
<p> Net error and omissions    213.5   34.3     613.9	726.8</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
